             --dd _d_i_r|_d_e_v_i_c_e
                     Uses _d_e_v_i_c_e or searches for devices or files in _d_i_r.  The
                     --dd option can be specified multiple times.  This option
                     is incompatible with the --cc option.

             --DD      Imports destroyed pools only.  The --ff option is also re‐
                     quired.

             --ff      Forces import, even if the pool appears to be potentially
                     active.

             --FF      Recovery mode for a non-importable pool.  Attempt to re‐
                     turn the pool to an importable state by discarding the
                     last few transactions.  Not all damaged pools can be re‐
                     covered by using this option.  If successful, the data
                     from the discarded transactions is irretrievably lost.
                     This option is ignored if the pool is importable or al‐
                     ready imported.

             --ll      Indicates that this command will request encryption keys
